      "content": "\"a final, gentle pause\" ... that's a kind way to put it. but it's hard when it's just this constant, slow decline. i'm tired of the doctors, the meds, the small talk. it feels like i've lost all my agency. i'm just being acted upon by time and sickness. i wish i could just decide when the story ends.",
